<https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/OperationsManagement> a owl:Class; dc11:subject <https://vocabularies.verizon.com/core-services/994db5b9-03f0-42cd-a96b-bc2fdec9760c>; rdfs:subClassOf <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/Services>, <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-lifecycle/RunTime>; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ontologies.verizon.com/ontology-core-domain/> .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/Communications> a owl:Class; dc11:subject <https://vocabularies.verizon.com/core-services/f59420c3-c47a-48a3-a73a-9405a4081589>; rdfs:subClassOf <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/Services>, <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-lifecycle/RunTime>; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ontologies.verizon.com/ontology-core-domain/> .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/ServiceLevelManagement> a owl:Class; dc11:subject <https://vocabularies.verizon.com/core-services/c0c59e21-9009-406f-92dc-9392f49e260a>; rdfs:subClassOf <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/Services>, <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-lifecycle/RunTime>; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ontologies.verizon.com/ontology-core-domain/> .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/Reporting> a owl:Class; rdfs:subClassOf <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-services/Services>, <https://ontologies.verizon.com/taxonomy-core-lifecycle/RunTime>; rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://ontologies.verizon.com/ontology-core-domain/> .

