<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/occursWhen> owl:equivalentProperty drm:occursWhen; owl:deprecated true .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/assignedTo> owl:equivalentProperty drm:assignedTo; owl:deprecated true .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/guides> owl:equivalentProperty drm:guides; owl:deprecated true .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/constrains> owl:equivalentProperty drm:constrains; owl:deprecated true .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/controls> owl:equivalentProperty drm:controls; owl:deprecated true .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/generates> owl:equivalentProperty drm:generates; owl:deprecated true .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/creates> owl:equivalentProperty drm:creates; owl:deprecated true .

<https://ontologies.verizon.com/upperontology/modifies> owl:equivalentProperty drm:modifies; owl:deprecated true .

